ens via bank wire until another bank account is added. Please confirm if you wish to proceed.\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"confirmDelete\":\"Yes, Delete\",\"adding\":\"Adding\",\"addDrawerSubtitle\":\"Provide details for the bank account where you want to receive your funds\",\"beneficiaryName\":\"Beneficiary Name\",\"beneficiaryAddress\":\"Beneficiary Address\",\"bankName\":\"Bank Name\",\"bankAddress\":\"Bank Address\",\"countryOfAccount\":\"Country of Account\",\"routingNumber\":\"Bank Routing Number\",\"routingNumberHelp\":\"Routing Number or SWIFT/BIC/Transit Number code\",\"accountNumber\":\"Bank Account Number\",\"confirmAccountNumber\":\"Confirm Bank Account Number\",\"referenceCode\":\"Additional Bank Reference Code\",\"referenceCodeHelp\":\"e.g., IBAN, Sort Code, etc\"},\"activity\":{\"close\":\"Close\",\"bought\":\"Bought\",\"sold\":\"Sold\",\"status\":{\"pending\":\"Pending\",\"processing\":\"Processing\",\"completed\":\"Completed\",\"cancelled\":\"Cancelled\",\"expired\":\"Expired\"},\"detail\":{\"amount\":\"Amount\",\"price\":\"Price\",\"valueChangeUsd\":\"Value Change in USD\",\"source\":\"Source\",\"destination\":\"Destination\",\"initiatedDateTime\":\"Initiated Date and Time\",\"initiatedTxHash\":\"Initiated Transaction Hash\",\"completedDateTime\":\"Completed Date and Time\",\"completedTxHash\":\"Completed Transaction Hash\"}},\"overview\":{\"cashBalance\":\"Cash Balance\",\"cashTooltip\":\"Total USDC balance available in your connected wallet(s).\",\"cashEmpty\":\"You don't have a wallet with this access. To get started, please join an Ondo product and add a wallet.\",\"yieldAssets\":\"Ondo Yield Assets\",\"yieldTooltip\":\"The total USD value of all your yield-bearing assets in your Ondo portfolio. It does not reflect other assets you may have in connected wallets.\",\"yieldNoAccess\":\"You don't have access to yield assets.\",\"yieldEmpty\":\"You have no yield assets.\",\"estimateYields\":\"Estimate Yields\",\"monthlyForecast\":\"Monthly Yield Fore