rchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement) regarding, and THE ONDO PERSONS SHALL NOT HAVE ANY LIABILITY WHATSOEVER WITH RESPECT TO ANYONE'S USE OF, any third-party products, services or technologies referenced herein.\n\nNothing herein constitutes any offer to sell, or any solicitation of an offer to buy, any Tokens. Nothing herein constitutes investment, legal, tax or financial advice. Acquiring the  Tokens involves risks. A holder of the Tokens may incur losses, including total loss of their purchase price. Past performance is not an indication of future results. Investors are responsible for conducting their own research, investigation, verification, checks or consultation for professional or investment advice.\n\nThe communications herein may contain forward-looking statements, including, but not limited to, statements regarding future financial performance, business strategies, or expectations for the growth or development of Ondo Finance, Ondo Global Markets (BVI) Limited, or any of their respective affiliates (each, an “Applicable Entity”). These statements are based on management's current expectations, estimates, projections, and beliefs, and are subject to a number of risks, uncertainties, and assumptions that could cause actual results to differ materially from those anticipated. Forward-looking statements can be identified by the use of terminology such as \"may,\" \"will,\" \"should,\" \"expect,\" \"intend,\" \"plan,\" \"anticipate,\" \"believe,\" \"estimate,\" \"predict,\" \"potential,\" \"continue,\" or the negative of these terms or other similar expressions. Factors that could cause actual results to differ materially from those contemplated by the forward-looking statements include, but are not limited to, the following: economic, competitive, legal, governmental, and technological factors affecting the operations, markets, products, services, or prices of any Applicable Entity. No Applicable Entity undertakes any obligation to update or revise any forward-looking statements, whether as a result of new information, future events, or otherwise, except as required by law.\n\nAdditional terms and restrictions apply. See docs.ondo.finance/legal/terms-of-service, docs.ondo.finance/ondo-stocks, ondo.finance/global-markets, app.ondo.finance and (as applicable) the Token offering documents for details."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"29:Td92,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"BlackRock Fund Advisors (“BlackRock”) is not the investment adviser, sub-adviser, portfolio manager, manager, sponsor, promoter, underwriter, marketer or distributor of the Onchain Portfolios or the Tokens, and does not manage, and exercises no discretion over, the Onchain Portfolios. BlackRock’s role is limited solely to providing one or more nondiscretionary model portfolio strategies (“Portfolio Strategies”) to Ondo Global Markets (BVI) Limited (“Ondo”) based on specifications provided by Ondo to BlackRock. BlackRock does not select, endorse, recommend, or make any investment decision with respect to any Onchain Portfolio or any assets held by any Onchain Portfolio, and any Onchain Portfolio may differ from the corresponding Portfolio Strategy for a variety of reasons. BlackRock shall have no obligation to provide updates to each Portfolio Strategy after the initial delivery of the Portfolio Strategy to Ondo except in certain limited circumstances. It is at Ondo’s arrangement whether any related Onchain Portfolio is similarly updated. Therefore, the Onchain Portfolios may not incorporate changes in the market or other events nor update in line with the Portfolio Strategies. BlackRock has no investment advisory, investment management, fiduciary, client or other relationship with, and owes no responsibilities or duties to, any investor or prospective investor in the Tokens or the Onchain Portfolios. The Portfolio Strategies are not designed to be suitable for any specific investor and do not take into account the individual needs, objectives or risk tolerance of any investor or prospective investor. BlackRock has not prepared or approved this document or any other offering or marketing material, and is not responsible for the tokenization, issuance, distribution, custody, or operation of the Tokens or the Onchain Portfolios. BlackRock is not making any offer to sell nor soliciting any offer to buy any securities. An investment in the Tokens involves risk, including the possible loss of principal, and past performance is not indicative of future results.\n\nInvestors have no right, title, interest, or claim in or to any of the funds or securities underlying any Onchain Portfolio (the “Underlying Funds”) or any recourse to any manager of the Underlying Funds, and such Underlying Funds are not being offered, marketed, or distributed to Investors by BlackRock or Ondo, whether directly or indirectly through the Tokens or the Onchain Portfolios. The Tokens constitute separate and distinct securities issued by Ondo and do not represent any interest in the Underlying Funds.\n\nThe Portfolio Strategies will include funds sponsored and managed by BlackRock and its affiliates, which will pay fees to BlackRock and its affiliates for providing management, administrative, or other services. Accordingly, BlackRock has a potential conflict of interest in connection with providing the Portfolio Strategies, as an investment in such funds by the Onchain Portfolio will increase compensation to BlackRock and its affiliates. BlackRock has an incentive to provide a Portfolio Strategy that contains funds that would result in increased levels of compensation being paid to BlackRock and its affiliates by such funds.\n\nAdditional information about BlackRock, including its Form ADV, is available from the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission’s Investment Adviser Public Disclosure website at https://adviserinfo.sec.gov."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:T477,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"¹ APY is generally updated each weekday, excluding holidays. APY is calculated based on the average income, net of expenses, earned over the 30 calendar days preceding and including the day that APY is updated. This yield reflects past performance. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Actual yields may vary depending on market conditions and other factors.  ² Yields are generally updated each weekday, excluding holidays. 7-Day Yield is calculated based on the average income, net of expenses, earned over the 7 calendar days preceding and including the day that the 7-Day Yield is updated. 30-Day Yield is calculated based on the average income, net of expenses, earned over the 30 calendar days preceding and including the day that the 30-Day Yield is updated. These yields reflect past performance. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Actual yields may vary depending on market conditions and other factors.  ³ Current Value excludes OUSG limited partnership interests represented in book-entry (non-tokenized) form.  ⁴ Other Assets consists funds in transit, outstanding receivables less payables"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"18:[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"footerContent\":{\"disclaimers\":[{\"pathname\":\"/assets/ousg\",\"content\":\"$23\"},{\"pathname\":\"/assets/[slug]\",\"content\":\"$24\"},{\"pathname\":\"/\",\"content\":\"$25\"},{\"pathname\":\"/assets/usdy\",\"content\":\"$26\"},{\"pathname\":\"/portfolio\",\"content\":\"$27\"},{\"pathname\":\"/intelligent-portfolios/[slug]\",\"content\":\"$28\"}],\"secondaryDisclaimers\":[{\"pathname\":\"/intelligent-portfolios/[slug]\",\"content\":\"$29\"}],\"footnotes\":[{\"pathname\":\"/assets/ousg\",\"items\":[\"$2a\"]},{\"pathname\":\"/assets/[slug]\",\"items\":[\"¹ Information source: https://site.financialmodelingprep.com. Neither Ondo Global Markets nor any of its associated persons or entities has conducted an independent assessment of the accuracy or completeness of this information.\",\"² The prices set forth herein are illustrative only, and are not indicative of any buy or sell price that a person may pay or receive for any Ondo Stocks. Realtime quote and/or trade prices are not sourced from all markets.\",\"³ Volume figures refer to the volume of the referenced asset, not of the token.\",\"⁴ Data reflects the preceding 24-hour history, except that data is not updated from Friday 8 PM through Sunday 8 PM ET or during other periods during which there is no trading session.\"]},{\"pathname\":\"/\",\"items\":[\"¹ The prices set forth herein are illustrative only, and are not indicative of any buy or sell price that a person may pay or receive for any Ondo Stocks.\"]},{\"pathname\":\"/assets/usdy\",\"items\":[\"¹ APY is set monthly by Ondo in accordance with the USDY governing documents.\",\"² Jurisdiction-based prohibitions and restrictions apply including [non-availability in the US.](https://docs.ondo.finance/general-access-products/usdy/faq/eligibility)\",\"³ The value of any redemption request is not subtracted from this number until it has been fulfilled.\",\"⁴ Total assets less liabilities. The value of any redemption request is not subtracted from this number until it has been fulfilled.\",\"⁵ This ratio excludes US Treasury securities used for structured financing and which constitute Opt-Out Lender Underlyings under the Amended and Restated Tokenized Credit and Security Agreement of Ondo USDY LLC.\",\"⁶ Liquidation Value\",\"⁷ Weighted Average Maturity\",\"⁸ Yield to Maturity\"]},{\"pathname\":\"/intelligent-portfolios/[slug]\",\"items\":[\"¹ Information source: https://site.financialmodelingprep.com. Neither Ondo Global Markets nor any of its associated persons or entities has conducted an independent assessment of the accuracy or completeness of this information.\",\"² The prices set forth herein are illustrative only, and are not indicative of any buy or sell price that a person may pay or receive for any Ondo Stocks. Realtime quote and/or trade prices are not sourced from all markets.\",\"³ Volume figures refer to the volume of the referenced asset, not of the token.\",\"⁴ Data reflects the preceding 24-hour history, except that data is not updated from Friday 8 PM through Sunday 8 PM ET or during other periods during which there is no trading session.\"]}]},\"children\":\"$L2b\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2c:I[32906,[\"6940\",\"static/chunks/50f238d9-a7e740ec78d317dc.js\",\"5733\",\"static/chunks/be197179-327e17c1a811955d.js\",\"3249\",\"static/chunks/990a3170-8e524cd4ffa152a7.js\",\"4689\",\"static/chunks/c74153a6-1e40f2eedf0307fa.js\",\"1287\",\"static/chunks/a29c7a05-ba52dd2afb1dac1a.js\",\"5930\",\"static/chunks/e2c7f2b4-5e7edf56609bee09.js\",\"2227\",\"static/chunks/6f8f4f9c-7ce9367cfc63b1a3.js\",\"8868\",\"static/chunks/3434f773-1160078c0c905a00.js\",\"1686\",\"static/chunks/d0a9d1a1-73104c972596fec9.js\",\"2762\",\"static/chunks/b3ffa0be-21233c69380f1f10.js\",\"1426\",\"static/chunks/2c344fa8-53e57957f5d83c14.js\",\"2830\",\"static/chunks/4eb5b067-ed22512cc36d4c44.js\",\"3763\",\"static/chunks/efe120fc-3b68b403f8537fc8.js\",\"1775\",\"static/chunks/865ecd89-e4c26e7c1b79fa98.js\",\"1677\",\"static/chunks/5f04a956-354cbaf91e9090c5.js\",\"5353\",\"static/chunks/4cc4ab89-30c85c6286b8f88b.js\",\"3774\",\"static/chunks/ac22cc25-61c57804ec6e7f0a.js\",\"9230\",\"static/chunks/54d4cd7b-8b8ca8cb5f51b2e4.js\",\"5150\",\"static/chunks/5150-e856f0b52c1632ca.js\",\"9736\",\"static/chunks/9736-b3bb07dcb3f4e029.js\",\"9246\",\"static/chunks/9246-23d710a8df6bd4e8.js\",\"1572\",\"static/chunks/1572-064325fbd149c1c7.js\",\"4566\",\"static/chunks/4566-1afaa543ee966acb.js\",\"7663\",\"static/chunks/7663-800675703cd20e29.js\",\"8955\",\"static/chunks/8955-5363ce4cd60a5302.js\",\"5912\",\"static/chunks/5912-205badf015d434c2.js\",\"4432\",\"static/chunks/4432-89d6263e233c76a9.js\",\"6081\",\"static/chunks/6081-bb96a4981a8658a2.js\",\"6883\",\"static/chunks/6883-52